      "text": "Trade Marks Regulations 1995 Part 17A.2 Definitions - Record of International Registrations Part 17A.66 Record of International Registrations"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Details of IRDAs and protected international trade marks are held on the Record of International Registrations. It is part of the current Trade Marks Office database."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "It includes the same information that is available on national applications and registrations. The following information is also included:"
        },
        {
          "depth": 1,
          "kind": "list_item",
          "text": "the international registration number"
        },
        {
          "depth": 1,
          "kind": "list_item",
          "text": "the date IP Australia was notified of the IRDA"
        },
        {
          "depth": 1,
          "kind": "list_item",
          "text": "the date the international registration is due for renewal"
        }
      ],
